002 - All Creatures of Our God and King
Francis of Assisi / Geistliche Kirchengesange
Key: D
Time: 3/2
Tempo: 96
Number: 2
Topic: Worship - Adoration and Praise

Verse 1:
[D/F#]All creatures [Bm]of [A]our [D/A]God [A7]and King,
[Bm]Lift up [A]your [A7]voice [D]with us [G/D]and sing:
[F#m]Alleluia! [D]Alleluia!
[A7]O burning sun [D]with [C#dim]golden [D]beam,
[Bm]And silver [A]moon [Bm]with softer [Em/B]gleam:

Refrain:
[F#m]Oh, praise [A]Him! Oh, [Em]praise Him!
[A7/G]Alleluia! [Em/B]alleluia!
[D/F#]Alleluia!

Verse 2:
[D/F#]O rushing [Bm]wind [A]and [A7]breezes soft,
[Bm]O clouds [A]that [A7]ride [D]the winds [G/D]aloft,
[F#m]Oh, praise [A]Him! [D]Alleluia!
[A7]O rising morn, [D]in [C#dim]praise [A]rejoice,
[Bm]O lights [A]of evening, [Bm]find [Em/B]a voice:

Verse 3:
[D/F#]O flowing [Bm]waters, [A7]pure and clear,
[Bm]Make music [A7]for [D]your Lord [G/D]to hear,
[F#m]Oh, praise [A]Him! [D]Alleluia!
[A7]O fire so masterful [A]and [D]bright,
[Bm]Providing [A]us [Bm]with warmth [Em/B]and light:

Verse 4:
[D/F#]Let all things [Bm]their [A7]Creator bless,
[Bm]And worship [A7]Him [D]in humbleness,
[F#m]Oh, praise [A]Him! [D]Alleluia!
[A7]Oh, praise the Father, [C#dim]praise [A]the [D]Son,
[Bm]And praise [A]the Spirit, [Bm]three [Em/B]in One!
